OL,3,GNEWSAFundraisers swim 1,000 lengths to
OL,4,Areopen pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FFundraisers have swum more than 1,000
OL,7,Flengths to help secure some of the
OL,8,Fmoney to reopen an open-air swimming
OL,9,Fpool which shut three years ago.
OL,11,FCounty Durham's only heated lido, at
OL,12,FStanhope in Weardale, closed in 2023
OL,13,Fafter a major electrical failure in its
OL,14,Fplant room.
OL,16,FThe group of swimmers from across the
OL,17,FWear Valley initially aimed to complete
OL,18,F804 lengths of Wolsingham Pool,
OL,19,Fequivalent to the 10 mile (16km) round
OL,20,Ftrip between Wolsingham and Stanhope,
OL,21,Fas part of their wider fundraising
OL,22,Fefforts.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
